{
  "title": "IO-PI",
  "views": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "path": "overview",
      "icon": "mdi:raspberry-pi",
      "type": "sections",
      "max_columns": 3,
      "header": {
        "card": {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "# IO-PI\nHeating I/O · Eight relays · Delta demand"
        }
      },
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Heating · IO-PI",
              "icon": "mdi:radiator"
            },
            {
              "type": "entities",
              "show_header_toggle": false,
              "entities": [
                {
                  "entity": "select.bmsiopi_heating_mode",
                  "name": "Heating mode"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "number.bmsiopi_return_cutoff",
                  "name": "Return-water cutoff"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.bmsiopi_heating_status",
                  "name": "Control status"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.bmsiopi_return_water",
                  "name": "Return water · BSB"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "sensor.bmsiopi_boiler_error",
                  "name": "Boiler error · BSB"
                },
                {
                  "entity": "binary_sensor.bmsiopi_thermostat",
                  "name": "Delta heat demand"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "button",
              "name": "Heat once",
              "icon": "mdi:fire",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "perform-action",
                "perform_action": "mqtt.publish",
                "data": {
                  "topic": "iopi/bmsiopi/heating/mode/set",
                  "payload": "Manual",
                  "retain": false
                },
                "confirmation": {
                  "text": "Heat once? This can start the radiator pump and request boiler heat."
                }
              },
              "hold_action": {
                "action": "none"
              },
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": 6,
                "rows": 2
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "button",
              "name": "Stop heating",
              "icon": "mdi:stop-circle-outline",
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "perform-action",
                "perform_action": "mqtt.publish",
                "data": {
                  "topic": "iopi/bmsiopi/heating/mode/set",
                  "payload": "Off",
                  "retain": false
                }
              },
              "hold_action": {
                "action": "none"
              },
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": 6,
                "rows": 2
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "**{{ states('sensor.bmsiopi_heating_status') }}**\n\nR1 requests boiler heat; R2 runs the radiator pump. Starts with five seconds of pump priming; stops at the return cutoff or one hour, then allows two minutes of pump run-on. Manual ignores room demand; Thermostat follows the Delta contact. Fresh boiler return/error feedback is required. {% if states('sensor.bmsiopi_return_water') in ['unknown','unavailable'] %}**Boiler feedback is unavailable; heat requests are blocked.**{% endif %}\n\n{% if states('binary_sensor.bmsiopi_thermostat') in ['unknown','unavailable'] %}**Delta input is not commissioned or unavailable.** {% endif %}GPIO26's raw level is not a heat-demand reading. Native boiler control still determines burner operation. [Building heating overview](/bms-overview/overview)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "heading": "Relay controls · R1–R8",
              "icon": "mdi:electric-switch"
            },
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "HIGH trigger · OFF = LOW GPIO drive. State is GPIO readback, without contact/load feedback. R3–R8 and independent pump operation use five-minute leases."
            },
            {
              "type": "button",
              "entity": "switch.bmsiopi_relay_1",
              "name": "R1 · Boiler request",
              "icon": "mdi:fire",
              "show_state": true,
              "tap_action": {
                "action": "toggle",
                "confirmation": {
                  "text": "Change R1 · Boiler request? This switches its connected circuit; pump run-on may delay OFF."
                }
              },
              "hold_action": {
                "action": "none"
              },
              "double_tap_action": {
                "action": "none"
              },
              "grid_options": {
                "columns": 6,
                "rows": 2
              }
            },
